# 1. Ignore absolutely everything
*

# 2. Allow the directories themselves so Git can look inside them
!*/
!**/

# 3. Re-include explicit list of allowed files or folders
!.gitignore
!skills/**
!CLAUDE.md
!global-git-guard.sh
!guard_test.sh
!LICENSE
!README.md
!settings.json
!statusline-command.sh

